<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
<title>JOBURA WEALTH® | NSE Institutional Wealth Management Platform</title>
<style>
:root{
--bg:#07111F;--panel:#111827;--panel2:#0f172a;--line:#23324d;
--accent:#2563eb;--green:#22c55e;--gold:#f59e0b;--text:#eef2ff;
}
*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:var(--text);font-family:Arial,sans-serif}
header{background:#0b1728;padding:18px 28px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center}
.brand h1{margin:0;color:#60a5fa} .brand h3{margin:4px 0 0;font-weight:400}
nav a{color:#cbd5e1;text-decoration:none;margin-left:18px}
.container{max-width:1500px;margin:auto;padding:22px}
.hero,.card{background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;padding:18px;margin-bottom:18px}
.kpis{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(180px,1fr));gap:14px}
.kpi{background:var(--panel2);padding:14px;border-radius:10px}
.kpi .v{font-size:28px;color:var(--green);font-weight:bold}
.workflow{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:12px}
.step{background:var(--panel2);padding:12px;border-radius:10px}
table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse}
th,td{padding:10px;border-bottom:1px solid #2a3a55}th{background:#162133;color:#93c5fd}
footer{text-align:center;padding:25px;color:#cbd5e1}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<header>
<div class="brand">
<h1>JOBURA WEALTH®</h1>
<h3>NSE Institutional Wealth Management Platform</h3>
<div>Professional Analytics Suite • Version 2026</div>
</div>
<nav>
<a href="/">Dashboard</a>
<a href="#">Research</a>
<a href="#">AI Advisor</a>
<a href="#">Risk</a>
<a href="/admin">Admin</a>
</nav>
</header>

<div class="container">

<div class="hero">
<h2>Executive Dashboard</h2>
<p>A comprehensive institutional investment platform designed for portfolio construction, dividend research, retirement planning, Monte Carlo simulations, institutional risk management and AI-powered investment decision support for the Nairobi Securities Exchange.</p>
</div>

<div class="kpis">
<div class="kpi"><div>AUM</div><div class="v">KES {{ "{:,.0f}".format(best_model_value|default(0)) }}</div></div>
<div class="kpi"><div>Portfolio Health</div><div class="v">93/100</div></div>
<div class="kpi"><div>Institutional Rating</div><div class="v">A+</div></div>
<div class="kpi"><div>Risk</div><div class="v">Moderate</div></div>
</div>

<div class="card">
<h2>Investment Workflow</h2>
<div class="workflow">
<div class="step"><b>1.</b><br>Select Strategy</div>
<div class="step"><b>2.</b><br>Enter Capital</div>
<div class="step"><b>3.</b><br>Run Simulation</div>
<div class="step"><b>4.</b><br>Review AI Analytics</div>
</div>
</div>

<div class="card">
<h2>Investment Input</h2>
<form method="POST">
<input name="target_amount" placeholder="Target Amount (KES)">
<input name="monthly" placeholder="Monthly Investment (KES)">
<input name="years" placeholder="Years">
<input name="transaction_code" placeholder="Transaction Code">
<input name="phone" placeholder="Phone">
<button type="submit">Run Institutional Engine</button>
</form>
</div>

<div class="card">
<h2>Cross-Model Portfolio Comparison</h2>
<table>
<tr><th>Model</th><th>Normal</th><th>Bull</th><th>Bear</th></tr>
{% for model,result in data.items() %}
<tr>
<td>{{model}}</td>
<td>{{ "{:,.0f}".format(result["normal"]["summary"]["value"]|default(0)) }}</td>
<td>{% if result["bull"] %}{{ "{:,.0f}".format(result["bull"]["summary"]["value"]|default(0)) }}{% endif %}</td>
<td>{% if result["bear"] %}{{ "{:,.0f}".format(result["bear"]["summary"]["value"]|default(0)) }}{% endif %}</td>
</tr>
{% endfor %}
</table>
</div>

<footer>
<b>JOBURA WEALTH®</b><br>
NSE Institutional Wealth Management Platform<br>
Powered by Monte Carlo Simulation Engine • AI Investment Advisor • Risk Analytics Framework • Goal-Based Wealth Planning Engine<br>
© 2026 Jobura Solutions. All Rights Reserved.
</footer>
</div>
</body>
</html>
